0emP7L67U9bDJY3VkVibKLa4yMuVypAeuRAxcg6c5tJtsAQhbXFMChNqcKjfE4cTia8owPKiaKq3HibFMTNhiamyeh95rjPDMicKY6YJM/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/s2rnWHA10emP7L67U9bDJY3VkVibKLa4yMuVypAeuRAxcg6c5tJtsAQhbXFMChNqcKjfE4cTia8owPKiaKq3HibFMTNhiamyeh95rjPDMicKY6YJM/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>为加强高校间优秀大学生的沟通和交流，增进优秀学生对（半导体学院）国家卓越工程师学院的了解，学院将于2026年7月初在深圳举办夏季交流营活动。欢迎全国的优秀学子踊跃报名！</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>日程安排</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>时间</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>2026年7月（暂定）</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>日程</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>开营仪式；师生交流；企业参观</span></p><p><span>*活动安排以最终公布为准；营员须按要求全程准时参加活动。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>活动费用：学院将为异地学校营员提供交流营期间在深圳的免费食宿，并给予部分来程路费补贴。深圳地区高校学生原则上不提供住宿，仅提供免费用餐。具体细节将于资格审核后另行通知。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>申请要求</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请交流专业</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>085400电子信息</span></p><p><span>085500机械</span></p><p><span>085600材料与化工</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请资格</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><ol><li><p><span><span>全国高校本科三年级在校生（2027届本科毕业生）；</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>本科专业为机械、电子信息、半导体材料、工艺、器件、设备等相关的领域；</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>“双一流”建设高校或相关专业的“双一流”建设学科，本科前三学年学习成绩专业排名前25%的学生；或其他学校成绩优异（本科成绩专业排名前10%）的学生；</span></span></p></li><li><p><span>身心健康、诚实守信、学风端正。</span></p></li></ol></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>导师名单</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>导师及研究方向详见：https://ngce.sustech.edu.cn/#/tutoralias=f0a303ea-9f2a-4cee-8454-f966c9ba6896</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>申请方式</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1. 报名时间：<span>即日起- 7月12日24:00</span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>2. 报名方式：申请人登陆南科大交流营网上报名系统注册登录，并按要求提供本人各项真实信息。网址：https://yzbm.sustech.edu.cn/（建议使用Chrome或360极速浏览器）</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>提交材料</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>需上传以下证明材料：</span></p><p><span>（1）身份证正反面复印件或照片；</span></p><p><span>（2）学生证复印件或照片；</span></p><p><span>（3）本科成绩单（请上传包含所修全部课程的正式成绩单（院系或教务公章），成绩单上注明所在专业的成绩排名。）；</span></p><p><span>（4）个人陈述（介绍学术背景、曾经做过的研究工作、以及将来攻读研究生阶段的学习和研究计划、研究生毕业后的就业目标等，1000字以内。）；</span></p><p><span>（5）其他体现个人学术水平、综合能力的证明材料（包括但不限于英语水平证书、论文首页及奖状证书等），扫描为一个PDF文件后上传至系统。</span></p><p><span>（6）交流营报名申请表（签字版）</span></p><p><span>（7）个人简历（1页）</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>提醒：入营报到时请携带有效的本人身份证和学生证进行资格审查。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>资格审核</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>交流营评审工作小组将对学生的申请材料进行审核，通过资格审核者将通过电子邮件（系统填写的邮箱）告知，未通过审核者不作另外通知。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>联系我们</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>邮箱：欢迎以“夏季交流营咨询”为主题发邮件至zgxyzb@sustech.edu.cn</span></span></p><p><span><span>电话：0755-88015406（宋老师）</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"e5ad17b5855629accb95c0525c752e0cd91bf06f2c671457d999a6f80a45cb26","textLength":1054,"sourceSha256":"b4b23b2b18de432f2ca6695579450d298724736f398c243570430ce14549baba","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-7399440110a25ebbc157","title":"2026年南方科技大学半导体学院（国家卓越工程师学院）2026年全国优秀大学生夏季交流营","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:17.823853+00:00"}
